            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "recommendations to the vice president for faculty and staff relations. The committee shall be comprised of an equal number of Union and management representatives, with an initial number of 3 representatives from each group. The committee shall be co-chaired by a labor representative and a management representative, with the co-chairs facilitating meetings on an alternating schedule. All expenses shall be the responsibility of each party participating on the committee. The statewide office of human resources will provide staff support for the committee. The parties will review possibilities for obtaining an audit of the health plan, including the prescription drug plan, upon mutually agreeable terms.",
